msgid "Donkarto - Gift Cards and Store Credit for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: donkarto.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/donkarto/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: donkarto.php
msgid ""
"Sell gift cards that email a redeemable code to the recipient and apply as a "
"discount at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Verkaufe Geschenkgutscheine, bei denen ein einlösbarer Code per E-Mail an "
"den Empfänger gesendet und an der Kasse als Rabatt gewährt wird."

#. Author of the plugin
#: donkarto.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
