msgid "List the gift cards an order issued"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/AbilitiesService.php:149
msgid ""
"Lists the gift card codes issued by one order, each with its remaining "
"balance. Returns an empty list when the order issued none."
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/AbilitiesService.php:197
msgid "Get the gift card settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/AbilitiesService.php:198
msgid ""
"Returns the gift card configuration in force: whether the feature is on, the "
"code prefix, the checkout discount label, whether codes are shown on the "
"order, and the wording of the email a recipient is sent. This is the shop's "
"own configuration, never a recipient address."
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/AbilitiesService.php:236
msgid "Check whether a product sells gift cards"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/AbilitiesService.php:237
msgid ""
"Returns whether a product is flagged as a gift card, and its current price, "
"which becomes the value of every code that product issues."
msgstr ""

